00:31:21.550 --> 00:31:25.780
And we'll see actually that it's
going to bring up a new version

00:31:25.780 --> 00:31:29.090
2.0 pod, and then it's going
to shut down a 1.0 pod.

00:31:29.090 --> 00:31:31.690
And then it's going to bring
up another 2.0 and shut down.

00:31:31.690 --> 00:31:34.990
And so eventually, we'll
have three of the 2.0 pods

00:31:34.990 --> 00:31:37.630
and zero of the
1.0 pods, but it's

00:31:37.630 --> 00:31:41.740
going to roll those updates.

00:31:41.740 --> 00:31:43.965
So actually, we can see here.

00:31:43.965 --> 00:31:45.090
We had those three running.

00:31:45.090 --> 00:31:47.680
We have two creating
of the new version.

00:31:47.680 --> 00:31:50.550
And again, up here
we see two and two

00:31:50.550 --> 00:31:53.160
as it's starting to
shut down one of those.

00:31:53.160 --> 00:31:56.790
Let's hit Refresh and
see the next state.

00:31:56.790 --> 00:31:58.350
So we still have some pending.

00:31:58.350 --> 00:32:01.680
We actually have
three of the new ones

00:32:01.680 --> 00:32:05.440
and one still shutting
down it looks like.

00:32:05.440 --> 00:32:08.110
All right, so now we've got
the green checkbox again.

00:32:08.110 --> 00:32:09.820
We have version 2.0.

00:32:09.820 --> 00:32:12.160
